hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1454","This is what Abu Al-Ahwas says, on the authority of Al-Amash, on the authority of Alqamah. This is what Abu Al-Ahwas says. He said: He said Abdullah “The Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, ordered me to recite to him while he was on the pulpit, so I recited to him from Surat An-Nisa until I reached the point of: So how when We bring from every nation a witness and bring you as a witness against these people. Surah An-Nisa, Verse 41. So I looked at him and his eyes shed tears."
